Package: interactionpower
Title: Simulation-Based Power Analysis for Interaction Effects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("DM", "Kloppenburg", , "dm-k1@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates data from a regression model with two predictors and
    their interaction, using standardized effects. Estimates the power to
    detect each effect at a given sample size, searches for the sample size
    at which all three effects reach a desired power, and plots the resulting
    power curves.
